045984,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZL8og","user":{"login":"carsonetb","id":63245844,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzMjQ1ODQ0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63245844?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb","html_url":"https://github.com/carsonetb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/carsonetb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-04T04:30:12Z","updated_at":"2025-01-04T04:30:12Z","body":"When I try to open your MRP the editor itself crashes without even needing to run the game with 4.3-stable and 4.4.dev7, there isn't really any debug info. I assume this is the same issue.\n\nRunning with the debugger I get an error at this line in gdscript_parser.cpp.\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1297ad5d-443a-4bc1-b31e-2128ea4cef7b)\n\nThe `identifier` variable has \"TranslationGoogleSheet\" as its name, but most of its other properties are 0x0000... (NULL).\n\nIf I delete that if statement which is supposedly greyed out, there's another error that crashes the editor:\n```\nERROR: GDScript bug: Native class \"Translation\" not found.\n   at: GDScriptCompiler::_gdtype_from_datatype (modules\\gdscript\\gdscript_compiler.cpp:123)\nmodules\\gdscript\\gdscript_compiler.cpp:123 - GDScript bug: Native class \"Translation\" not found.\nERROR: FATAL: Condition \"!exists\" is true.\n   at: HashMap<class StringName,int,struct HashMapHasherDefault,struct HashMapComparatorDefault<class StringName>,class DefaultTypedAllocator<struct HashMapElement<class StringName,int> > >::operator [] (C:\\Users\\black\\godot\\core/templates/hash_map.h:538)\n```\nI can't look further into this right now but if anyone wants to pick up where I left off that's fine.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2570045984/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2570256638","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101073#issuecomment-2570256638","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101073","id":2570256638,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZMwD-","user":{"login":"Synzorasize","id":60207816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjA3ODE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60207816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize","html_url":"https://github.com/Synzorasize","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-04T06:24:34Z","updated_at":"2025-01-04T06:24:34Z","body":"The `Translation` class does not have a `ResourceFormatLoader`, which may be part of the issue. Therefore, it cannot be properly loaded from disk, only created at runtime. Adding a `ResourceFormatLoader` for it might solve the issue of the crash at runtime.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2570256638/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2571101181","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101073#issuecomment-2571101181","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101073","id":2571101181,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZP-P9","user":{"login":"MrMMatricks","id":2734039,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI3MzQwMzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2734039?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMMatricks","html_url":"https://github.com/MrMMatricks","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMMatricks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMMatricks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMMatricks/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMMatricks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMMatricks/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMMatricks/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMMatricks/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMMatricks/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MrMMatricks/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-04T10:06:32Z","updated_at":"2025-01-04T10:06:32Z","body":"> The `Translation` class does not have a `ResourceFormatLoader`, which may be part of the issue. Therefore, it cannot be properly loaded from disk, only created at runtime. Adding a `ResourceFormatLoader` for it might solve the issue of the crash at runtime.\n\nWell, I can create resource files from the Translation class and use them in editor and at runtime without any issues. Only the classes that inherit from it produce the crash. So I'm not sure of that is the problem.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2571101181/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2571337201","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101073#issuecomment-2571337201","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101073","id":2571337201,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZQ33x","user":{"login":"Synzorasize","id":60207816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjA3ODE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60207816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize","html_url":"https://github.com/Synzorasize","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-04T15:43:00Z","updated_at":"2025-01-04T15:43:00Z","body":"I forgot to mention that the loading error is specific to the `ProjectSettings`. When I loaded a `Translation` through the `locale/translations` setting in my own project, it gave an error while loading. However, it loaded successfully using the `load` and `ResourceLoader.load` methods. I used the `.tres` file extension instead of `.translation`, however.\n\nPerhaps these two methods fallback on the default `ResourceFormatLoader` while the `ProjectSettings` or GDScript parser doesn't. I worked around this by loading it manually in code, but I think it would be more efficient to be able to set it directly in the ProjectSettings. I don't think this is the direct cause of this issue specifically, but it will need to be tested.\n\nI will try to test further when I get to my computer.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2571337201/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5200007036","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/101073#issuecomment-5200007036","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/101073","id":5200007036,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABNfHPfA","user":{"login":"Synzorasize","id":60207816,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwMjA3ODE2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60207816?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize","html_url":"https://github.com/Synzorasize","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Synzorasize/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-06T03:21:20Z","updated_at":"2026-08-06T03:21:20Z","body":"Still reproducible in master [51105ccbe58381774ecd7a7486d564b202a5192e]:\n```\nERROR: No loader found for resource: res://languages/en.tres (expected type: unknown)\n   at: _load (core/io/resource_loader.cpp:332)\n```","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5200007036/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]